Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼噼噼噼噼...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:33.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！住手！救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.12,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.29,0:00:35.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要不行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.69,0:00:36.64,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:39.32,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蔥膏降世的神皮！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:42.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:46.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你小空 保護了我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:49.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:51.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.79,0:00:54.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,再來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:01.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空很來勁 就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:04.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的沒有問題嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:05.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,虹丘真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.81,0:01:09.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,去藍天大地的由由阿姨來電話了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.81,0:01:09.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(670,965)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:10.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:11.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 小空 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:15.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲... 跑起來很危險的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}究極的力量！神威大典
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(1160,960)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50}Majesty Chronicon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.07,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:00.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,愛！愛愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:02.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？有事情嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:08.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？沒有 那麼要我們來幫忙的是什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,國王陛下招呼我過來 是想請我調查藍天大地的某樣東西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:16.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,某樣東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在一週前 從湖底出現的遠古遺跡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.19,0:03:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很奇妙吧 為什麼那種東西突然就出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟又是何物...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:39.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一個問題就是那座遺跡 沒有發現入口
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然湖中我們也調查過了...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這都寫了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:47.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是古藍天大地文嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弟弟厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“拯救世人的究極力量 沉眠在此”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“掌握這份力量吧 命運之子”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:58.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,命運之子...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.83,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:04.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世人的究極力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:11.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,愛！啊欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:13.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想的沒錯 小空就是關鍵角色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:23.84,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,欸嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:26.79,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:28.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 公主 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:29.53,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:31.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我來打頭陣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:32.22,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,愛愛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.39,0:04:36.53,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢走 慢慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:38.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:40.00,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:44.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡可能是很危險的地方吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.15,0:04:46.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:50.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊哈哈哈... 你... 你們想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.09,0:04:55.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定是會有這種 又會有那種的陷阱橋段哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:57.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:04:59.12,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:04.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我想了想... 不該帶小空進去的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:06.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就我們幾個進去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:11.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.69,0:05:14.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想讓小空遭遇危險
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這個想法 我們大伙都是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:18.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,國王他們也是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主就麻煩你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:26.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,遺跡在召喚小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:29.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也在迎面走向命運
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:35.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空現在肯定是沒辦法理解很深奧的事情的...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:36.76,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:42.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我們能夠辦到的 就是保護好小空 輔助好她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:47.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,變身成Cure Majesty的小空是很強
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:49.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:50.39,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空要去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:52.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,一起去吧 真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:54.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:56.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:02.11,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚 嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:07.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！抱歉 抱歉 我們一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:10.25,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚... 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.25,0:06:15.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 拒絕不了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:19.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嚇到你了吧 抱歉 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:27.68,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:32.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:36.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？要怎麼通過啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:37.57,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,愛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:40.56,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:43.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,地板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:44.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.37,0:06:46.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 當心一點！要走在地板上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:49.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠踩上去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:52.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喲... 沒有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:53.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是少年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只會對正統的繼承者展開道路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 地板自己動起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:08.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世人的究極力量 究竟是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:11.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主還會繼續變強到哪種水平
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:13.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,比如巨大化？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:13.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:16.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘎哦 嘎！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:20.54,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空修！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:23.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太... 也太強了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:25.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 我開玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:27.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊 是開玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:29.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（三人嬉笑）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:31.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不是太多慮了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:36.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是... 再繼續前進萬一小空就受傷了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:38.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,留下了痛苦的記憶 要怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:41.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是不希望發生這種事...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊 陽光明媚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲欸！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:56.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 出大事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:29.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這畫... 難道是小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:35.83,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,快看！書！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:37.68,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:40.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:40.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(630,1060)}公主
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:41.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:44.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是只有Precure才能進入最後的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後面的就交給你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:14.39,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:20.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是書... 書就是究竟力量嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:23.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,《神威大典》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:23.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Majesty Chronicon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:25.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 你知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:28.42,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:31.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:34.89,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？啊欸？啊欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:36.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 我來試試？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.46,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:43.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚！嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:48.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,呼... 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:50.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是被封印起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（震動聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:18.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:28.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:49.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼能夠輸給暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:50.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你可是武人吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:52.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,武人？
