Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:25.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來做個了斷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.31,0:13:27.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧！但是先要...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:30.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,等你擺脫了暗塌谷能量的控制！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:34.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:39.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.87,0:13:45.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:48.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,蝦兵蟹將！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:50.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:52.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:53.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:05.00,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.99,0:14:14.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:21.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.73,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒結束
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:27.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾才是... 最強！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:53.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 Majesty... 小空在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:00.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:07.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:12.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:33.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,奏效時間已經過了嗎... 不過...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:39.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism 你沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（腳步聲...）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:51.14,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典！請給予我們究極力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.43,0:15:53.28,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典 拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:16.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,“當Precure心連心 一條心之時”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:19.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“神威大典便會翻開 奇蹟的篇章”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:27.78,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,心連心...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:36.09,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！把手放到大典上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:49.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.85,0:16:51.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 你還好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:54.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,還好... 大伙 手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:06.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:10.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？我們應該是一條心的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:23.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾的... 勝利！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.24,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典 保護了我們？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:38.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,護盾裂了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:41.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,連大典的力量都擋不住嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:42.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:47.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我一直都不想讓小空牽扯到戰鬥裡來...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:51.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,所以神威大典的力量才沒辦法覺醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:53.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是說這種話的時候嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續下去 Majesty 還有我們...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:56.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:03.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:13.83,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:15.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:32.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,應該我來保護你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.64,0:18:33.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:37.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,請相信小空的決心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:38.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:42.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 小空她也會擔心我們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,想要保護我們的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:47.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是能夠體會的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:50.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因為和那時候是一樣的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:57.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不願意真白同學受傷 哪怕是一根毫毛...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:01.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候 真白同學是對我這麼說的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:05.89,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:11.29,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我擔心你 我想幫助你 我們心意相通
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:15.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,這還不足以作為一起戰鬥的理由嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.26,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:40.66,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Majesty Chronicon！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:27.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,起身飛向海闊天空的世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:55.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,光美！天威虹暈！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:55.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure！Majestic Halation！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:05.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.62,0:21:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:14.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的一切早已知曉...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.91,0:21:17.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,知識宮殿是不會有假的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我見識過了 天威虹暈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.59,0:21:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓吾奪回武人之心的這份恩情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會報答你們的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後會有期 勁敵們！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌諾彤彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:43.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個自說自話的傢伙 還有很多事情想問他的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:47.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,武人嘛 肯定有武人為人處世的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.17,0:21:48.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.09,0:21:49.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:53.61,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻... Prism 可喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:55.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是的 Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:22:00.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻... 嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:09.43,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:09.43,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1075,970)}威愛愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.97,0:22:13.23,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 要和我一起跳哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:49.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 這本畫書 是新作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.40,0:23:50.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.20,0:23:51.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,畫了很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.64,0:23:53.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我太喜歡畫畫了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:55.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 怎麼了？公主
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.07,0:23:57.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蚱蜢！蚱蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.98,0:24:00.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.98,0:24:00.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.37,0:24:03.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蜢蜢！真白與歸來的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.27,0:01:18.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:24.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:29.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.62,0:01:37.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:42.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:46.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:48.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.22,0:01:52.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:57.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:01:59.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.19,0:02:03.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:07.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:10.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:13.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:18.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:23.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:28.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:33.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:36.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:44.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
